---
import Section from './ui/Section.astro';
import SectionHeading from './ui/SectionHeading.astro';
import Card from './ui/Card.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Section page>
  <SectionHeading
    as="h1"
    title="CODE OF CONDUCT"
    subtitle="Everyone is welcome at the table"
  />

  <Card>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
      OZ ORC exists to bring the glories of old-school gaming to everyone in
      Adelaide. Whether you're a grizzled grognard or entirely new to the hobby,
      everyone is welcome to bring their dice, snacks, and wits to test
      themselves against the dangers of the deepest delves.
    </p>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
      We are committed to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment for all
      attendees, no matter their background or experience level. Our goal is to
      grow the hobby by ensuring everyone feels safe, respected, and excited to
      play.
    </p>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Harassment, discrimination, or behavior that makes others feel unwelcome
      has no place at OZ ORC. If you experience or witness any issues, please
      speak to an organizer immediately. We will address all concerns seriously
      and take appropriate action, including removal from the event if
      necessary. Let's make this a day of adventure and camaraderie for all.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 text-center">
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="btn btn-primary">
        Contact Organizers
      </a>
    </div>
  </Card>
</Section>
